sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant F as Frontend
    participant S as Supabase
    participant SC as Smart Contract
    U->>F: Connect Wallet & Sign
    F->>S: Auth Request
    S-->>F: Return JWT & RBAC
    U->>F: Request Asset Action
    F->>SC: Verify On-Chain Role
    SC-->>F: Validation Success
    F->>S: Log Access (DB)
    S->>SC: Anchor Audit Batch (Merkle)
